<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<scheme version="2.0" title="6차시 ① 웨이퍼 맵 한 장 — 표의 X·Y를 점으로 찍기 (완성)" description="교육용 가상 데이터 실습 워크플로. data/weekly 폴더와 orange3 폴더를 키트의 폴더 구조 그대로 두고 여세요.">
	<nodes>
		<node id="0" name="File" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.data.owfile.OWFile" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="File (파일 불러오기)" position="(120.0, 320.0)" />
		<node id="1" name="Scatter Plot" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.visualize.owscatterplot.OWScatterPlot" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="Scatter Plot (산점도)" position="(300.0, 320.0)" />
		<node id="2" name="Box Plot" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.visualize.owboxplot.OWBoxPlot" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="Box Plot (상자 그림)" position="(300.0, 460.0)" />
		<node id="3" name="Distributions" qualified_name="Orange.widgets.visualize.owdistributions.OWDistributions" project_name="Orange3" version="" title="Distributions (분포 막대)" position="(300.0, 600.0)" />
	</nodes>
	<links>
		<link id="0" source_node_id="0" sink_node_id="1" source_channel="Data" sink_channel="Data" enabled="true" source_channel_id="data" sink_channel_id="data" />
		<link id="1" source_node_id="0" sink_node_id="2" source_channel="Data" sink_channel="Data" enabled="true" source_channel_id="data" sink_channel_id="data" />
		<link id="2" source_node_id="0" sink_node_id="3" source_channel="Data" sink_channel="Data" enabled="true" source_channel_id="data" sink_channel_id="data" />
	</links>
	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/plain" rect="(40.0, 30.0, 760.0, 190.0)" font-size="16">완성본: File → Scatter Plot(다이_X·다이_Y, 색 합격여부), File → Box Plot(중심거리_mm, Subgroups 합격여부),
        File → Distributions(중심거리_mm, Split by 합격여부).
둥근 웨이퍼 모양이 보이고, 불합격 점이 가장자리 고리에 몰립니다.</text>
	</annotations>
